release runtime libraries from the installed Visual Studio 2022 Redistributable
tree. Those files retain Microsoft's terms. Their published distribution list
and application-local deployment documentation are available at:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/releases/2022/redistribution
